{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adon_olam","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n44.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adon_olam/adon_olam"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Lord of the world, He who has reigned before any form was created. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adon_olam/leet_naasah"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"At the time when by His will everything came into being, then was His Name proclaimed as King. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adon_olam/veacharei"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And after everything ceases to be then He alone inspiring awe will reign. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adon_olam/vehu_hayah"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He was, He is and He will be in glory. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adon_olam/vehu_echad"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He is unique and there is no second to compare with Him or to associate with Him. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adon_olam/beli_reshit"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Without beginning, without end, to Him might and dominion belong. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adon_olam/vehu_eli"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He is my God and my Redeemer lives . "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"text":"The rock of my portion in time of distress. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adon_olam/vehu_nissi"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He is my banner and a refuge for me, the portion of my cup on the day I call. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adon_olam/beyado"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Into His hand I entrust my spirit at the time I sleep and I awake. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adon_olam/veim_ruchi"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And with my spirit my body. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"text":"God is with me, I do not fear. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
